  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">OUTPUT 2.3: INNOVATIVE FINANCE AND STRATEGIC PARTNERSHIPS</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">The Regional Office strengthens and diversifies strategic partnerships with bilateral and multilateral partners, regional organizations, civil society, private sector (in alignment with Outcome 3), and youth networks to mobilize resources, influence policy, and co-create solutions that advance child rights and social justice. The Regional Office leads and supports multi-country flagship partnerships, including on ending violence against children, promoting early childhood development, and addressing issues faced by children on the move. It also fosters cross-border collaboration, South-South cooperation, innovative financing and policy change to address systemic inequities. Partnership initiatives support impactful Business Engagement and Partnerships interventions to promote responsible business conduct to children&apos;s rights (aligned to output 3.3). This activity contributed to sublevel results - Cross sectoral - Communication and Advocacy</narrative>
  </description>
