   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Regional Office strengthens and diversifies strategic partnerships with bilateral and multilateral partners, regionalorganizations, civil society, private sector (in alignment with Outcome 3), and youth networks to mobilize resources, influencepolicy, and co-create solutions that advance child rights and social justice. The Regional Office leads and supports multi-countryflagship partnerships, including on ending violence against children, promoting early childhood development, and addressing issuesfaced by children on the move. It also fosters cross-border collaboration, South-South cooperation, innovative financing and policychange to address systemic inequities. Partnership initiatives support impactful Business Engagement and Partnerships interventionsto promote responsible business conduct to children?s rights (aligned to output 3.3).</narrative>
   </title>
